NAME
     login - log in

SYNOPSIS
     login [USER]

DESCRIPTION
     login asks for a name and a password, checks them against
     /etc/passwd and /etc/shadow, and starts that user's shell with
     their groups, their home directory and their environment. Failures
     are logged and slowed down.

SEE ALSO
     su(1), sudo(1), passwd(1), getty(8)
